{
  "slug": "claude-trinity",
  "name": "Claude Trinity",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Autonomous Planner → Generator → Evaluator build pipeline for Claude Code.\n\nOne sentence prompt. Full product. No manual intervention.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills**, **10 agents** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `pge` (PGE Orchestrator — autonomously runs Planner → Generator → Evaluator pipeline for multi-sprint product builds), `pge-autolaunch`, `pge-clean`, `pge-eval-backend` (Select the evaluator backend for PGE pipeline — claude (default), codex, or gemini), `pge-god` (PGE God Mode — absolute maximum quality pipeline), `pge-idontcaretokenanymore` (PGE idontcaretokenanymore — premium unlimited-token pipeline), `pge-indicator`, `pge-limit` (Set or clear a usage-based auto-pause threshold for PGE pipelines), and 8 more\n- **Agents** (10): `evaluator-codex` (Codex-backed PGE evaluator), `evaluator-gemini` (Gemini-backed PGE evaluator), `evaluator-godmode` (God Mode PGE evaluator), `evaluator-quality` (Quality PGE evaluator), `evaluator-standard` (Standard PGE evaluator), `evaluator-strict` (Strict PGE evaluator), `evaluator` (Use this agent when a sprint has been completed by a generator agent and needs rigorous evaluation, OR…), `generator` (Use this agent when you need to implement a product sprint based on a product specification, incorporating QA…), and 2 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `pge-orchestrator`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-trinity@claude-community` from `orion-gz/Claude-Trinity`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 16,
    "agent": 10,
    "mcp": 1
  },
